invalid type: string "As an example, let $X = \\lbrace A,B\\rbrace $ , $Y_A = \\lbrace \\text{$a_{1}, a_{2}$, $a_3$}\\rbrace $ , $Y_B = \\lbrace \\text{$b_1, b_2,$ $b_3$}\\rbrace $ , and $k=3$ . Each $a_i$ and $b_i$ has 2 possible values, $a_{i1}$ or $a_{i2}$ and $b_{i1}$ or $b_{i2}$ respectively. Thus, mapping an input symbol to 48 ( $Y_A = \\lbrace \\text{$a_{1}, a_{2}$, $a_3$}\\pÿkÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ